1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,419
Atomic weight is equivalent weight times valency: nine times three, twenty seven.

2
00:00:06,419 --> 00:00:07,851
That is aluminium.

3
00:00:07,851 --> 00:00:13,880
And valency is atomic weight over equivalent weight: forty over twenty, two.

4
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:15,104
That is calcium.

